{'symbol': 'LH', 'date': '2023-06-28 18:08:00', 'title': 'FORTREA HOLDINGS AND PHINIA SET TO JOIN S&P SMALLCAP 600', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 28, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P DOW JONES INDICES WILL MAKE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES TO THE S&P SMALLCAP 600 EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPENING OF TRADING ON THURSDAY, JULY 6: FORTREA HOLDINGS INC. (NASD:FTRE) WILL REPLACE SENECA FOODS CORP. (NASD:SENEA). S&P 500 CONSTITUENT LABORATORY CORPORATION OF AMERICA HOLDINGS (NYSE:LH) IS SPINNING OFF FORTREA HOLDINGS IN A TRANSACTION EXPECTED TO BE COMPLETED ON JULY 3.'}